@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. 세션 생성: 응답에서 세션 ID 자동 저장 (IntelliJ HTTP Client)
POST {{baseUrl}}/usecases/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{"userId":"sample-user"}

> {%
    client.test("Session created", function () { client.assert(response.status === 200); });
    client.global.set("usecaseSessionId", response.body.sessionId);
%}

### 2. 상품 수량 설정
PUT {{baseUrl}}/usecases/carts/{{usecaseSessionId}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId":"1","quantity":2}

### 3. 조회: 세션과 장바구니 TTL 갱신
GET {{baseUrl}}/usecases/carts/{{usecaseSessionId}}

### 4. 수량 0: 항목 제거
PUT {{baseUrl}}/usecases/carts/{{usecaseSessionId}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId":"1","quantity":0}

### 만료/없는 세션: 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/usecases/carts/missing-session
